title Receipt to Money Manager

User [color: lightblue] {
  Capture receipt photo [icon: camera]
  Review fields [icon: edit]
  Approved? [type: gateway, icon: check]
  Draft kept [type: event, icon: x-circle]
  Duplicate warning [type: event, icon: alert-triangle]
  Transaction written [type: event, icon: check-circle]
}

System [color: orange] {
  "POST /extract-receipt" [icon: server]
  "Validate upload (image type, 10 MB)" [icon: shield]
  Build Gemini request [icon: file-text]
  Parse and validate JSON [icon: shield]
  Check for duplicate [icon: search]
  "Duplicate found?" [type: gateway, icon: filter]
  Create transaction [icon: send]
  Log corrections [icon: file-text]
}

Gemini API [color: purple] {
  generateContent [icon: cpu]
}

Money Manager [color: green] {
  Transactions [icon: database]
}

Capture receipt photo > "POST /extract-receipt" : Image and known merchants
"POST /extract-receipt" > "Validate upload (image type, 10 MB)"
"Validate upload (image type, 10 MB)" > Build Gemini request : Prompt, JSON schema, temperature 0
Build Gemini request > generateContent : Image as base64 inline_data
generateContent > Parse and validate JSON : Merchant, date, amount, description, lines
Parse and validate JSON > Review fields : Pre-filled form
Review fields > Approved?
Approved? > Check for duplicate : Yes
Approved? > Draft kept : No
Check for duplicate -- Transactions : Query by date, amount, vendor
Check for duplicate > "Duplicate found?"
"Duplicate found?" --> Duplicate warning : Yes
"Duplicate found?" > Create transaction : No
Create transaction --> Transactions : Write
Create transaction > Log corrections
Log corrections > Transaction written
